    "text": "<p><img src=\"assets\\st0048_06a984147f27.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.97986in;height:2.32014in\" /></p><p>Let <math><mi>d</mi></math> be the distance between the tower and house<br /><math><mo>&#8756;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>60</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>60</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">cot</mi></mrow><mo>&#8289;</mo><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>30</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></math><br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>60</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
